  "subject": "a woman who spends every Sunday dawn kneeling in the road making crayon rubbings of Taiwan's decorated city manhole covers onto cloth, while her boyfriend, who first laughed at the hobby, now stands guard against scooters and hunts for new covers himself",
  "caption": "Taiwanese Hokkien Afro house, organic melodic Afro house in the 2025 Ibiza style. Deep rounded four-on-the-floor kick; hand-played congas and djembe in interlocking patterns; dry wooden marimba riff carrying the hook; brushed shakers; warm sub bass. Clean modern club mix, wide percussion, airy reverb on the marimba. Warm female alto lead, clearly sung melody, light male answer lines on the hooks. Clear full voice, every word enunciated, steady sung melody on every line. 122 BPM, A minor. Sunny Sunday-morning playfulness, in love. No amapiano log drum, no trap hi-hats, no autotune, no EDM drop or riser, no rap.",
  "lyrics": "[Verse]\n禮拜日透早 街仔猶靜靜\n我跪佇路中央 布攤予平\n蠟筆一下抹 花就浮出來\n城市的鐵蓋 刻甲遮爾媠\n\n[Pre-Chorus]\n你徛佇邊仔 共我顧車\n你講 較緊咧 較緊咧\n\n[Chorus]\n抹抹抹 鐵蓋的花\n一塊一塊 我掛規厝\n你笑我戇 毋過你\n閣共我捀蠟筆盒仔\n\n[Verse]\n台南的蓋仔 有古城門\n嘉義的蓋仔 有小火車\n機車對頭前 叭一聲過\n阮兩人 走甲像賊仔\n\n[Pre-Chorus]\n警察來問 恁咧創啥\n你講 阮咧畫地圖\n\n[Chorus]\n抹抹抹 鐵蓋的花\n一塊一塊 貼滿眠床\n你笑我戇 毋過你\n已經會曉家己揣\n\n[Verse]\n今年咱欲環島一輪\n後車斗 囥一百條布\n你講後擺咱的新厝\n窗仔簾 用孔蓋布\n\n[Bridge]\n人行過 攏無看跤底\n干焦咱 一路看落去\n\n[Chorus]\n抹抹抹 鐵蓋的花\n一塊一塊 是咱的路\n你笑我戇 毋過你\n跪落來 陪我抹\n\n[Outro]\n抹抹抹 鐵蓋的花\n禮拜日 閣來一塊",
